# Modern Design & White Theme Overhaul Across Complete Application

Implement a modern white theme as the default design system across the entire application (`/`, `/terminal`, `/admin/terminal`, `/portfolio`, etc.), ensuring all text, borders, cards, and interactive elements conditionally and dynamically adapt between White Theme and Dark Themes. Remove inline CSS styling across components and migrate them into structured classes in [global.css](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/styles/global.css).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Modern White Default**: The application will default to the clean, high-contrast **Modern White** theme with pure white surfaces, soft slate borders, dark slate text, and crisp green/red accents.
> - **Unified Theme Switcher**: A global theme switcher will be accessible from both the application navbar and the terminal, allowing immediate toggling between Modern White, Nordic Snow, Cyber Midnight, Pure Obsidian, Bloomberg Slate, Emerald Quant, Neon Nebula, and Titanium Charcoal.
> - **Conditional Text Color**: All text colors will be dynamically conditioned on the active theme via semantic CSS variables and conditional classes, completely eliminating white-on-white text, invisible borders, and low-contrast elements.
> - **Removal of Inline CSS**: Heavy `style={{ ... }}` objects in [Trade.tsx](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/pages/Trade.tsx) and [App.tsx](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/App.tsx) will be refactored into semantic classes in [global.css](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/styles/global.css).

