## Proposed Changes

### Global Theme System & Design Tokens
#### [NEW] [ThemeContext.tsx](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/store/ThemeContext.tsx)
- Create a global `ThemeContext` providing `theme`, `setTheme`, `isLight`, and `themes` list.
- Read and persist theme selection in `localStorage` under `"terminal_theme"` (defaulting to `"modern-white"`).
- Automatically set `data-theme` on `document.documentElement` on change.

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/index.html)
- Set `<html lang="en" data-theme="modern-white">` to prevent dark-mode flash on initial load.

#### [MODIFY] [main.tsx](file:///d:/python-pron/paper-trading-platform/frontend/src/main.tsx)
- Wrap application with `ThemeProvider` so all routes and components share the same theme state.

